cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite the accompanying paper."
title: "Continual Compositional Zero-Shot Learning (CCZSL) Benchmark"
abstract: >-
  A benchmark for Continual Compositional Zero-Shot Learning, in which
  attributes and objects recur across sessions while their compositions
  change. Built on top of MIT-States, UT-Zappos, and C-GQA. Ships
  per-session pair splits (train/val/test/all) and per-image metadata
  (session-scoped and cumulative-across-sessions).
